    "landingProblemBody": "Barnaamijyada luqadda ee guud waxay Af-Finnishka ku baraan si guud. Floently waxay ku baraysaa Af-Finnishka aad runtii ugu baahan tahay waxyaabaha noloshaada beddeli kara: gudbidda YKI, shaqo helidda, iyo noqoshada muwaadin.",
    "landingOutcomeWallTitle": "YKI waa caqabad weyn, ma aha khadka dhammaadka",
    "landingOutcomeWallBody": "Bartayaal badan waxay u baahan yihiin wax ka badan casharro luqadeed oo guud. Waxay u baahan yihiin Af-Finnishka imtixaanka YKI, shaqada, xiriirka maalinlaha ah — iyo waddada dheer ee dhalashada iyo deggenaanshaha joogtada ah.",
    "landingOutcomeWorkplaceTitle": "Af-Finnishka goobta shaqadu waa xirfad gaar ah",
    "landingOutcomeWorkplaceBody": "Shaqaalaha caalamiga ah waxay u baahan yihiin Af-Finnish shaqo oo wax ku ool ah: isgaarsiin ammaan ah xilliga shaqada, bilow shaqo oo fudud, iyo kalsooni luqadeed oo ka caawisa inay shaqada ku sii nagaadaan.",
    "landingOutcomeCitiesTitle": "Magaalooyinku waxay mas’uul ka yihiin natiijada la-qabsashada",
    "landingOutcomeCitiesBody": "Dadka deegaanka waxay u baahan yihiin taageero luqadeed oo barashada ku xirta shaqo-helidda, ka-qaybgalka, iyo ka mid noqoshada bulshada Finland — ma aha oo keliya shahaado fasal lagu dhammeeyay.",
    "landingPlatformEyebrow": "HAL MADAL, SADDEX WADDO",
    "landingPlatformTitleLine1": "YKI, goobta shaqada,",
    "landingPlatformTitleHighlight": "iyo nolosha Finland.",
    "landingPlatformBody": "Saddex waddo oo ku jira hal madal. Dooro midda yoolkaaga ku habboon — ama dhammaan saddexda u isticmaal hay’ad.",
    "landingPlatformYkiEyebrow": "Diyaarinta YKI",
    "landingPlatformYkiTitle": "Waxaa lagu dhisay afarta xirfadood ee imtixaanka.",
    "landingPlatformYkiBody": "Hadlid, qoris, akhris, dhagaysi — tababar la hagayo oo jawaab-celintiisu la jaanqaaddo shuruudaha qiimaynta YKI ee shaqada, dhalashada, iyo deggenaanshaha joogtada ah.",
    "landingPlatformProfessionalEyebrow": "Af-Finnishka xirfadeed",
    "landingPlatformProfessionalTitle": "Dhakhaatiirta, kalkaaliyeyaasha caafimaadka, iyo kalkaaliyeyaasha daryeelka.",
    "landingPlatformProfessionalBody": "Xaalado, eray-bixin, iyo wada-sheekaysiyo u gaar ah xirfadda. Wareejinta bukaanka, diiwaangelinta caafimaadka, wada-shaqaynta maalinlaha ah — luqadda shaqada dhabta ah, ma aha xaalado buug ku eg.",
    "landingPlatformLifeEyebrow": "Nolosha Finland",
    "landingPlatformLifeTitle": "Adeegyada maalinlaha ah iyo xiriirka rasmiga ah.",
    "landingPlatformLifeBody": "Af-Finnishka aad ugu baahan tahay KELA, Migri, daryeelka caafimaadka, dugsiyada, bangiyada, iyo yoolalka muddada dheer ee dhalashada iyo deggenaanshaha joogtada ah.",
    "landingInsideEyebrow": "WAXA KU JIRA",
    "landingInsideTitleLine1": "Hal madal oo isku xirta",
    "landingInsideTitleLine2": "YKI, shaqada, iyo isdhexgalka.",
    "landingInsideBody": "Bartuhu mar walba wuxuu u dhexeeyaa diyaarinta imtixaanka, Af-Finnishka xirfadeed, iyo Af-Finnishka nolol maalmeedka. Floently waxay dhammaan ku haysaa hal waddo oo joogto ah.",
    "landingPathwayLearnersEyebrow": "Bartayaasha",
    "landingPathwayLearnersTitle": "Gudub YKI, u diyaar garow shaqo, oo dhis Af-Finnish waara.",
    "landingPathwayLearnersBody": "Tababar la hagayo oo daboola akhris, dhagaysi, qoris, iyo hadlid — laguna dhisay yoolalka YKI iyo Af-Finnishka aad runtii uga baahan tahay shaqada iyo nolol maalmeedka.",
    "landingPathwayLearnersCta": "Bilow barashada",
    "landingPathwayEmployersEyebrow": "Loo shaqeeyayaasha",
    "landingPathwayEmployersTitle": "Shaqaalaha caalamiga ah si fiican u soo dhowee, u sii hay, una ilaali.",
    "landingPathwayEmployersBody": "Af-Finnish gaar u ah goobta shaqada si loo helo isgaarsiin ammaan ah, bilow shaqo oo degdeg ah, iyo sii-hayn shaqaale oo muddo dheer ah. Waddooyin xirfadeed oo loogu talagalay daryeelka caafimaadka iyo wixii ka dambeeya.",
    "landingPathwayEmployersCta": "Ballan demo loo shaqeeye qaado",
    "landingPathwayCitiesEyebrow": "Magaalooyinka iyo degmooyinka",
    "landingPathwayCitiesTitle": "Waddo luqadeed oo la ballaarin karo — laga bilaabo deganayaal ilaa muwaadiniin.",
    "landingPathwayCitiesBody": "Ku xir barashada luqadda shaqo-helidda, la-qabsashada, iyo ka-qaybgalka muddada dheer. Barnaamijyo ka bilaabmi kara hal qof oo degane ah kuna fidi kara heer magaalo oo dhan.",
    "landingPathwayCitiesCta": "Nala hadal",
    "landingTrustYkiAligned": "La jaanqaadaya YKI",
    "landingTrustProfessionSpecific": "Xirfad gaar ah",
    "landingTrustWorkplaceCommunication": "Isgaarsiinta goobta shaqada",
    "landingTrustSettlementSupport": "Taageerada la-qabsashada",
    "landingTrustProgrammeScalable": "Ku habboon barnaamijyo la ballaarin karo",
    "landingFinalEyebrow": "DIYAAR MARKAAD DIYAAR TAHAY",
    "landingFinalTitleLine1": "Barashada Af-Finnishka u soo dhowee",
    "landingFinalTitleLine2": "shaqada, la-qabsashada, iyo fursadaha.",
    "landingFinalBody": "Haddii aad isu diyaarinayso YKI, taageerayso shaqaale caalami ah, ama waddo barnaamij magaalo/degmo ah, Floently waxaa loo dhisay natiijooyin dhab ah — ma aha Af-Finnish guud oo buug keliya ku eg.",
