    "onboardingWelcomeHeroLine3": "Finland iska leh.",
    "onboardingWelcomeSubhead": "Waxaa loo dhisay kalkaalisooyin, takhaatiir, iyo kalkaalisooyin wax ku ool ah oo diyaarinaya YKI iyo nolosha shaqada ee Finland. Ma aha abka luqadda guud",
